codex
I will apply a revised region rule: suppress maintenance alerts when `users_affected <= 0.5`. For the second condition, I will use `urgency <= 0.8` with the candidate’s other limits. The evidence supports this choice but does not establish the exact cutoff. I will preserve the existing network and add ReLU gates.

